  "about": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "I'm a sophomore at the University of Texas at Dallas. I enjoy problem-solving and coding. I'm an eager learner of anything and I always strive to bring 100% to the work I do. I have worked using languages like Java, Python, C/C++, and C# using technologies like LWJGL, OpenGL, Keras, and Unity, etc during my programming experience. I am passionate about developing applications that solve real world issues that occur at the unique intersection of physics, math, and computer science.",
      "I am looking for an opportunity to learn more about the fields of AI, Software Development, game development, as well as learn as much as I can about everything computer science!"
    ],
